# The test image builds from the repository root so it can reach the shared
# tests/ tree. Without this, every package's node_modules and build output
# would be shipped to the daemon as build context.
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.storage

contracts/artifacts
contracts/cache
contracts/typechain-types
contracts/deployments

.git
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.docker
